# The exported design canvas.
#
# Deliberately not committed. It is a MOCK — invented stories, invented
# failures, three directions of which one was built — and a mock in the repo
# beside the thing it described drifts from it the first time a token is tuned.
# This codebase's own rule is that a documented guard nobody maintains is worse
# than a missing one, because it is read as covered; a stale design reference is
# the same shape.
#
# What was worth keeping from it is in the code: the palette provenance and the
# alarm band's reasoning are in partials/base-css.blade.php, and the decisions
# are in CLAUDE.md. Those cannot drift from the console because they are the
# console.
/redesign
